        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 20px;\n    background-color: #fff;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 1.8em;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n    color: #222;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .checkmark {\n    width: 25px;\n    color: #f04a8b;\n    font-size: 1.3em;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 1.1em;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .stars {\n    color: #f04a8b;\n    font-size: 1.2em;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .description {\n    margin-left: 25px;\n    font-size: 0.95em;\n    color: #444;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #f04a8b;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;\n    text-underline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n  .handwritten {\n    color: #f04a8b;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"KaiTi\", cursive, serif;\n    font-size: 1.2em;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    transform: rotate(-2deg);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</h1>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">马房湾 66 号江湖菜</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    非常出名的<span class=\"underline\">重庆江湖菜</span>，味道超级地道，推荐<span class=\"underline\">江湖第一蒸</span>，<span class=\"underline\">辣子鸡</span>、<span class=\"underline\">招牌血旺等</span>，环境是七八十年代怀旧风，集颜值与味道于一身的江湖菜 <span class=\"handwritten\">重庆江湖菜TOP1</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">洋马儿火锅</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    一家藏得很深的火锅，很正宗的<span class=\"underline\">九宫格火锅</span>，九宫格上面放着鹅卵石，虾滑、毛肚超好吃\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">君之薇火锅</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    这是一家藏在半山腰上的火锅店<span class=\"underline\">已经有 20 多年历史了</span>，味道还是那么霸道，重点是还便宜，性价比超高，冰汤圆和卤味系列的菜是我的最爱，他们家包子还超好吃\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">六指烧烤</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    烧烤店也能排队排到心累，碳火考出来的烧烤真的太香了，特别喜欢吃<span class=\"underline\">烤豆干</span>，里面放一些他们家的泡萝卜，好吃到哭\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">沈姐烤鱼</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    很正宗的<span class=\"underline\">重庆万州烤鱼</span>，就在重庆大学 B 区，烤鱼有多种味道，最爱吃的还是<span class=\"underline\">香辣味</span>，性价比很高，一大条鱼才几十块钱的样子\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">熨斗糕老烧饼</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    <span class=\"underline\">在较场口的梯坎上</span>，在繁华的大都市中，买上一只只卖 5 毛钱的熨斗糕满满的童年回忆，Q弹软嫩，烧饼也很好吃，价格也很感人！\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">望江楼三鲜砂锅米线</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    虽然比较远，但是真的是跟度假一样，到这里安静，淳朴！<span class=\"underline\">藏在大山上 25 年的砂锅米线</span>，一排灶孔可同时煮很多砂锅，每一位料都非常丰富，鲜香四溢！\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">食济粮重庆特产严选超市</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    重庆买特产的好去处，是连锁店，正规不会被坑，他们家的<span class=\"underline\">上下城火锅底料</span>还不错，作为本地人都经常买来煮火锅\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"item\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">老院子肥肠鸡</span>\n    <span class=\"stars\">★★★</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"description\">\n    这家店在老居民楼的坝坝里，每天人都是爆满，他们家的<span class=\"underline\">肥肠鸡非常入味</span>，滴着油的肥肠柔韧又有弹性，口感很不错\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
